    {
      "id": "0c5f7f6ee781-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The ratio of the ages of A and B, 3 years ago, was 5 : 7. The ratio of their ages, 13 years from now, will be 9 : 11. If the present age of C is 11 years less than that of B, then the present age of C, in years, is:",
      "questionHtml": "The ratio of the ages of A and B, 3 years ago, was 5 : 7. The ratio of their ages, 13 years from now, will be 9 : 11. If the present age of C is 11&nbsp;years less than that of B, then the present age of C, in years, is:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "23",
          "html": "23"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "36",
          "html": "36"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "31",
          "html": "31"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "20",
          "html": "20"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Let the present ages of A and B be A and B respectively.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span>(A - 3) / (B - 3) = 5 / 7 ⇒ 7A - 5B = 6 .....(1)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span>(A + 13) / (B + 13) = 9 / 11 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span>11A - 9B = -26 ....(2)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span>A = 23 and B = 31</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span>C = B - 11 = 20 years.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0c5f7f6ee781-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Let 3t - \\(1\\over3t\\) = 3, then which of the following expressions has the value equal to 12?",
      "questionHtml": "Let 3t -&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1\\over3t\\)</span>&nbsp;= 3, then which of the following expressions has the value equal to 12?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2} + 2 \\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2} + 2 \\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2}\\) - 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2}\\)</span>&nbsp;- 2"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2} + 1 \\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2} + 1 \\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2} \\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(9t^2 + \\frac{1}{9t^2} \\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>3t - 1/(3t) = 3</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Squaring both sides: 9t</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> + 1/(9t</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">) - 2 = 9</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">9t</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> + 1/(9t</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">) = 11</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">9t</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> + 1/(9t</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">) + 1 = 11 + 1 = 12</span></p>\n",
