      "number": 4,
      "question": "The following table shows the number of students admitted in to a university for higher education from 2010 to 2013. Year Number of Students 2010 450 2011 540 2012 370 2013 680 What is the average number of students admitted in to the university from 2010 to 2013?",
      "questionHtml": "The following table shows the number of students admitted in to a university for higher education from 2010 to 2013.\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>Year</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Number of Students</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2010</td>\n\t\t\t<td>450</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2011</td>\n\t\t\t<td>540</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2012</td>\n\t\t\t<td>370</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2013</td>\n\t\t\t<td>680</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\nWhat is the average number of students admitted in to the university from 2010 to 2013?",
