        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "495",
          "html": "495"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "499",
          "html": "499"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "510",
          "html": "510"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "522",
          "html": "522"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>According to the question,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The average number of students admitted in to the university from 2010 to 2013</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (450 + 540 + 370 + 680)/4</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 510</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The average number of students admitted in to the university from 2010 to 2013 is 510.</strong></p>\n",
