      "questionHtml": "The value of <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{sin^2\\theta - 2sin^4\\theta}{2cos^4\\theta + cos^2\\theta}\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\theta = 45\\)</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(^\\circ\\)</span>&nbsp;is:",
