      "question": "The sale of two kinds of bicycles B1 and B2 (in lakhs) manufactured by a company over a period of three years are shown in the table below. Year B1 B2 2001 95 184 2002 130 200 2003 150 216 From 2001 to 2003, the total sale of bicycles B1 is what percent of the total sale of bicycles B2?",
      "questionHtml": "The sale of two kinds of bicycles B1 and B2 (in lakhs) manufactured by a company over a period of three years are shown in the table below.\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"9bea5808-666d-4ec5-83ac-a310f533914e\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o-mini\" dir=\"auto\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>Year</th>\n\t\t\t<th>B1</th>\n\t\t\t<th>B2</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2001</td>\n\t\t\t<td>95</td>\n\t\t\t<td>184</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2002</td>\n\t\t\t<td>130</td>\n\t\t\t<td>200</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2003</td>\n\t\t\t<td>150</td>\n\t\t\t<td>216</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\nFrom 2001 to 2003, the total sale of bicycles B1 is what percent of the total sale of bicycles B2?",
