      "id": "0c5f7f6ee781-q12",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "A customer pays ₹975 in instalments. The payment is done each month ₹5 less than the previous month. If the first instalment is ₹100, how much time will be taken to pay the entire amount?",
      "questionHtml": "A customer pays ₹975 in instalments. The payment is done each month ₹5 less than the previous month. If the first&nbsp;instalment is ₹100, how much time will be taken to pay the entire amount?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "14 months",
          "html": "14 months"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "15 months",
          "html": "15 months"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "27 months",
          "html": "27 months"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "26 months",
          "html": "26 months"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>975 = <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{n}{2} [2(100) + (n-1)(-5)] \\)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> = <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{n}{2} [200 - 5n + 5]\\)</span></span> = <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{n}{2} [205 - 5n]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>1950 = n(205 - 5n) = 205n - 5n²</p>\n\n<p>5n² - 205n + 1950 = 0 ⇒ n² - 41n + 390 = 0 </p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">n = [41 ± √(41</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> - 4×1×390)] / 2 ⇒ [41 ± √121] / 2 </span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">n = 26 or n = 15</span></p>\n\n<p>Since n must be positive and feasible:</p>\n\n<p>n = 15</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
