      "id": "0c5f7f6ee781-q15",
      "number": 15,
      "question": "The following table represents the total number of students in different classes and the respective number of students who are vegetarian, in a school. Study the table carefully and answer the question that follows. Class Total number of students Number of vegetarian students XII 150 105 XI 165 100 X 125 80 IX 140 90 What is the percentage of non-vegetarian students in class XII?",
      "questionHtml": "The following table represents the total number of students in different classes and the respective number of students who are vegetarian, in a school. Study the table carefully and answer the question that follows.\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>Class</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Total number of students</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Number of vegetarian students</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>XII</td>\n\t\t\t<td>150</td>\n\t\t\t<td>105</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>XI</td>\n\t\t\t<td>165</td>\n\t\t\t<td>100</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>X</td>\n\t\t\t<td>125</td>\n\t\t\t<td>80</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>IX</td>\n\t\t\t<td>140</td>\n\t\t\t<td>90</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\nWhat is the percentage of non-vegetarian students in class XII?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "40%",
          "html": "40%"
