      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Total number of students in class XII is 150</p>\n\n<p>Number of vegetarian students in class XII is 105</p>\n\n<p>According to the question,</p>\n\n<p>Non - Vegetarian student in class XII is 150 - 105 = 45</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (45/150)&times; 100</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 30%</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The correct answer is 30%.</strong></p>\n",
